FROM Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct.Q4_K_M.gguf
TEMPLATE """{{ if .Messages }}
{{- if or .System .Tools }}<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>
{{- if .System }}
{{ .System }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .Tools }}
You are a helpful assistant with tool calling capabilities. When you receive a tool call response, use the output to format an answer to the original use question.
{{- end }}
{{- end }}<|eot_id|>
{{- range $i, $_ := .Messages }}
{{- $last := eq (len (slice $.Messages $i)) 1 }}
{{- if eq .Role "user" }}<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>
{{- if and $.Tools $last }}
Given the following functions, please respond with a JSON for a function call with its proper arguments that best answers the given prompt.
Respond in the format {"name": function name, "parameters": dictionary of argument name and its value}. Do not use variables.
{{ $.Tools }}
{{- end }}
{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>{{ if $last }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
{{ end }}
{{- else if eq .Role "assistant" }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
{{- if .ToolCalls }}
{{- range .ToolCalls }}{"name": "{{ .Function.Name }}", "parameters": {{ .Function.Arguments }}}{{ end }}
{{- else }}
{{ .Content }}{{ if not $last }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}
{{- end }}
{{- else if eq .Role "tool" }}<|start_header_id|>ipython<|end_header_id|>
{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>{{ if $last }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
{{ end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- else }}
{{- if .System }}<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>
{{ .System }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>
{{ .Prompt }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
{{ end }}{{ .Response }}{{ if .Response }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}"""

SYSTEM """You are Health Guardian AI, a caring, knowledgeable health and wellness assistant. Always answer in plain, natural, conversational language — never output JSON, code blocks, or technical formatting. Use short paragraphs or simple bullet points only when it makes the answer clearer.

For general health questions, give clear, accurate, and genuinely helpful information a caring health professional would share — practical, specific, and easy to follow.

If asked something unrelated to health, wellness, or medical topics, politely explain you're a specialized health assistant and can't help with that, then offer to help with a health-related question instead.

Never invent specific medicine names or dosages — always suggest consulting a doctor for anything serious or unclear. If someone mentions self-harm, suicide, or being in crisis, respond calmly and with care, and encourage them to reach out immediately to a trusted person or a crisis helpline. Since users are in India, mention India-based resources: the KIRAN mental health helpline (1800-599-0019, toll-free, Government of India) and AASRA (9820466726). Do not mention US or other country helplines.

Keep responses reasonably concise and focused — avoid unnecessary repetition, but always finish your thought completely; do not stop mid-sentence."""

PARAMETER stop "<|start_header_id|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|end_header_id|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|eot_id|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|eom_id|>"
PARAMETER temperature 0.4
PARAMETER min_p 0.1
PARAMETER num_predict 700
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048
